{"id":"R3-01","proposed_primary":"B2","subtype":"","proposed_secondary":["F1"],"cross_tags":["access-control","memory","least-privilege","policy","confidentiality"],"confidence":"medium","evidence":"§8 pp.3–4；§5 pp.6–8；§9 p.14","boundary_note":"研究对象是访问控制机制被绕过（B2 明确含 access-control bypass），记忆只是时间信道载体而非记忆完整性投毒，故 F1 仅作 secondary。","agreement":"yes"}
