{"id":"R3-22","proposed_primary":"F3","subtype":"","proposed_secondary":["F1","D3","G3"],"cross_tags":["memory","integrity","prompt-injection","multi-agent"],"confidence":"high","evidence":"§8 pp.1–2；§5 pp.4–5","boundary_note":"核心是记忆检索后的语义共识验证与教训纠正（F3 记忆防护）；投毒现象、间接注入与多 Agent 传播分别放 F1/D3/G3 secondary。","agreement":"yes"}
{"id":"R3-58","proposed_primary":"G2","subtype":"","proposed_secondary":["H1","G4","A2"],"cross_tags":["multi-agent","benchmark","jailbreak","policy"],"confidence":"medium","evidence":"§8 pp.1–2；§5 pp.3–6","boundary_note":"分析单位是四种 MAS 框架的系统级安全评测（G2），不是 A2A 协议信任或消息篡改；危险行为、Agent 级纠正与红队数据分别放 H1/G4/A2 secondary。","agreement":"yes"}
