{"id":"R3-21","proposed_primary":"H1","subtype":"","proposed_secondary":["D3","D4","A2"],"cross_tags":["prompt-injection","jailbreak","policy","integrity"],"confidence":"medium","evidence":"§8 pp.1–2；§5 pp.3–5","boundary_note":"核心是模型层拒绝/安全检查与危险任务行为安全（H1），不是后门或训练数据投毒；注入防御、多步轨迹与基准评测放 D3/D4/A2 secondary。","agreement":"yes"}
