{"id":"R3-46","proposed_primary":"I1","subtype":"","proposed_secondary":["A2","H1","D2"],"cross_tags":["cua","gui","benchmark","prompt-injection","privacy","integrity"],"confidence":"medium","evidence":"§8 pp.3–6；§5 pp.4–7","boundary_note":"按研究对象是真实 OS/GUI 计算机使用环境中的 CUA 风险（I1），符合 A2 收紧规则；通用 benchmark 产出、有害任务与注入分别放 A2/H1/D2 secondary。","agreement":"yes"}
